      "review_description": "I received 3 Solar Quotes from Finn Peacock but did not choose any as it took about 3 weeks for 1 out of 3 to email me a quote to which by then I had done my own research and choose Sun Solar QLD in Acacia Ridge, very happy with their service. I had salesman come out the 14th of April, he was very informative and helpful,(with the information I got from Finn Peacock I knew the salesman knew his products) signed contract 21st April, Sun Solar wanted to Install on the 3rd May which was not suitable for me, was installed on 11th May, I'm very happy with Installation. Only took 3 hours and Energex are coming 13th June to do their part.I must say that Finn Peacock's web site was VERY INFORMATIVE it was what helped me in many areas to make my decision and my research.Thank You Finn Peacock!",
